    <div class=3D"card">
      <div class=3D"card-header"><div class=3D"card-title">Beta Analysis</d=
iv><div class=3D"card-subtitle">Unlevered &amp; Re-levered Beta</div></div>
      <div class=3D"formula-box">
Unlevered Beta (=CE=B2U):
  =CE=B2U =3D =CE=B2L / [1 + (1-t) =C3=97 (D/E)]
  =CE=B2U =3D 0.82 / [1 + 0.76 =C3=97 0.344]
  =CE=B2U =3D 0.82 / 1.262 =3D 0.65

Re-levered Beta (=CE=B2L):
  =CE=B2L =3D =CE=B2U =C3=97 [1 + (1-t) =C3=97 (D/E)]
  =CE=B2L =3D 0.65 =C3=97 1.262 =3D 0.82

Sector Median Unlevered Beta (peers):
  SGS: 0.62 | BV: 0.64 | Eurofins: 0.68
  =E2=86=92 Sector average =CE=B2U =E2=89=88 0.65 =E2=9C=93 Consistent
      </div>
      <h4>WACC Sensitivity Range</h4>
