      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>ERP Justification</h4>
        <p class=3D"body" style=3D"font-size:12px;">5.2% UK ERP sourced fro=
m Damodaran's January 2024 country risk premium estimates. UK ERP reflects:=
 (1) historical Dimson-Marsh-Staunton UK equity premium of 4.9%; (2) curren=
t implied ERP from market valuation levels (~5.2=E2=80=935.5%). Our estimat=
e is conservative and consistent with sell-side consensus.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Risk-Free Rate</h4>
        <p class=3D"body" style=3D"font-size:12px;">4.15% reflects the 10-y=
ear UK Gilt yield as of December 2024. This is appropriate as: (1) Intertek=
's majority revenue and cost base is GBP-proximate (reporting currency); (2=
) 10Y tenor matches DCF forecast horizon; (3) The risk-free rate includes m=
arket-implied inflation expectations consistent with our revenue growth for=
ecasts.</p>
