price in cost synergies (lab consolidation, overhead reduction) and revenue=
 synergies (cross-selling), justifying higher multiples than standalone pub=
lic valuation.</li>
          <li><strong>Acquisition momentum</strong> =E2=80=94 Competitive M=
&amp;A processes drive up multiples; sellers run formal processes to maximi=
se price.</li>
          <li><strong>Private information discount elimination</strong> =E2=
=80=94 Acquirers with access to management presentations have higher convic=
tion than public shareholders, reducing their required discount.</li>
